OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FShowers will
OL,6,Fslowly ease and become more scattered
OL,7,Ftonight with some longer dry spells,
OL,8,Fthough there will be quite a lot of
OL,9,Fcloud. Winds easing down.
OL,10,
OL,11,CThursday:FA cloudy start then
OL,12,Fbrightening up from the south with
OL,13,Fsome good spells of sunshine. Moderate
OL,14,Fsoutherly breeze and a bit milder.
OL,15,
OL,16,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FCloudier
OL,17,Fwith some rain likely on Friday, then
OL,18,Fbright and mainly dry on Saturday and
OL,19,FSunday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
